#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:5 3c38a658e20644f1a6bd5454c60f508e
msgid "3DR Solo (Developer Information)"
msgstr "3DR Solo（开发者信息）"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:7 c13eac674526402db8a46ede9ea4b98a
msgid ""
"This page provides instructions for developers working with the 3DR Solo "
"Ready-to-fly copter.  The comprehensive `3DR solo dev guide can be found "
"here <http://dev.3dr.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"本页面为在 3DR Solo 即飞四轴飞行器上进行开发的开发者提供相关说明。完整的 `3DR Solo 开发者指南请见此处 "
"<http://dev.3dr.com/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:14 31821d0686424aca92c32312c51a249e
msgid "Uploading custom firmware to the Pixhawk2"
msgstr "将自定义固件上传到 Pixhawk2"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:16 ba1fe53128bd4058a3acd7a48bb31050
msgid ""
"Solo `can be flown with ardupilot/master "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WeOl7BficG0>`__ but when shipped by 3DR it "
"runs a modified version of APM:Copter3.3."
msgstr ""
"Solo `可以使用 ardupilot/master 飞行 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WeOl7BficG0>`__，但 3DR 出厂时运行的是 APM:Copter3.3"
" 的修改版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:19 bbe8f246c3774e88adff1407d71a7c7d
msgid ""
"The firmware `can be found on Github here "
"<https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-solo/releases>`__."
msgstr ""
"固件 `可在 Github 上找到 <https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-"
"solo/releases>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:20 7d2f2d9f8d8a47fabfee2611ff86c3ec
msgid ""
"The source code can be found here: `ardupilot "
"<https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-solo/>`__, `PX4Firmware "
"<https://github.com/3drobotics/PX4Firmware-solo>`__, `NuttX "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4NuttX>`__."
msgstr ""
"源码可在此处找到：`ardupilot <https://github.com/3drobotics/ardupilot-"
"solo/>`__、`PX4Firmware <https://github.com/3drobotics/PX4Firmware-"
"solo>`__、`NuttX <https://github.com/ArduPilot/PX4NuttX>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:25 1d90408af94445a6afbe8be7bc8b1f24
msgid ""
":ref:`Compile instructions are the same as for master ardupilot for a "
"Pixhawk <building-the-code>` with the exception that the modified repos "
"should be used."
msgstr ""
":ref:`编译说明与 Pixhawk 上的 ardupilot master 相同 <building-the-code>`，但需使用修改后的仓库。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:27 e50c95da17404010af34d15e72b5f48f
msgid ""
"After modifying/building the firmware, turn on the Solo and connect your "
"PC's network to the Solo controller's access point using the same "
"login/password used by the Solo app (by default these are something like: "
"``SoloLink_XXXXXX/sololink``)."
msgstr ""
"修改/构建固件后，打开 Solo 电源，将电脑的网络连接到 Solo 控制器的接入点，使用与 Solo "
"应用相同的登录名/密码（默认类似：``SoloLink_XXXXXX/sololink``）。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:31 376390cc39d741ae93da20f0065be0b0
msgid ""
"Use *scp* to copy the **ArduCopter-v2.px4** file from your PC to "
"**root@10.1.1.10:/firmware** (i.e. the firmware directory on the IMX6 on the"
" Solo vehicle).  Windows users in particular may want to install `Putty "
"<http://www.putty.org/>`__ and use a command like below:"
msgstr ""
"使用 *scp* 将 **ArduCopter-v2.px4** 文件从您的电脑复制到 **root@10.1.1.10:/firmware**（即 "
"Solo 飞行器 IMX6 上的固件目录）。Windows 用户可考虑安装 `Putty <http://www.putty.org/>`__ "
"并使用类似以下的命令："

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:43 6fc85e060b1c45599b422bf9ea7720f1
msgid ""
"The SSH-PASSWORD should be replaced with the actual ssh password for your "
"vehicle. The default root password is TjSDBkAu."
msgstr "SSH-PASSWORD 应替换为您飞行器的实际 SSH 密码，默认 root 密码为 TjSDBkAu。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:47 fc26b51cc256405aac22f84932260b78
msgid ""
"Reboot the vehicle and the vehicle's IMX6 should load the firmware onto the "
"Pixhawk2 (you should see the regular rainbow colours on the arm LEDs as the "
"upload proceeds)."
msgstr "重启飞行器，IMX6 应将固件加载到 Pixhawk2（上传过程中机臂 LED 应显示正常的彩虹颜色）。"

#: ../../source/docs/solo.rst:50 8a892b9561424f7b8b8fef330d8de1d5
msgid ""
"After uploading the firmware is moved to the **/firmware/loaded** directory."
msgstr "上传完成后，固件将被移至 **/firmware/loaded** 目录。"

